(globalThis.CATALOGUE_RECORD_CHUNKS??=Object.create(null))[688]={"source_order":688,"notes":["No page number is visible on this verso. The supplied folio label 'fol. [344b]' is preserved only as metadata.","Scattered specks across the page were judged to be paper flecks rather than pencil marks, based on their size and shape at native resolution.","The right strip beyond x≈3125 (the gutter shadow and the ruled paper beyond it) belongs to the facing page, fol. 345. It shows only ruling and specks and was not treated as target content.","The left ruled margin column runs from about x≈330 to x≈850, with the vertical rule at about x≈850. It was inspected and contains no writing.","Image-reviewed finding: the target page (fol. [344b]) is a ruled verso with a left margin column (vertical rule at about x≈850) and a main column. After review of the overview and all six native tiles, covering the top, middle, bottom, left margin, main column, interlinear spaces and gutter, no handwriting, pencil, ticks, numbers or other catalogue marks are visible.","Physical features only: a small folded or turned-down corner at the top left (about [333,322,70,75]); a faint grey smudge near mid-page (about [1690,2710,70,70]); scattered specks and paper flecks, including two in the left margin near the bottom (about [700,4255,30,45]); and a small nick or tear at the foot of the gutter (about [3125,4830,100,50]). None of these is legible as writing.","No page number is visible. The supplied label 'fol. [344b]' is preserved only as metadata.","The strip to the right of about x≈3125 belongs to the facing page, fol. 345. It shows only ruling and specks and was not treated as target content. Adjacent fol. 344 and fol. 345 also appear blank apart from their folio numbers '344' and '345', which are context only."],"records":[]};
